#ASSERT NOT (`s 280(c)(1) the corporation or successor entity must petition the Court of Chancery to determine the security for the pending claim` WITH `the corporation or successor entity has given notice in accordance with subsection (a)` IS TRUE, `the claim is the subject of a pending action, suit or proceeding to which the corporation is a party` IS FALSE, `the claim is barred pursuant to subsection (a)` IS FALSE)
