#ASSERT `s 280(c)(2) the corporation or successor entity must petition the Court of Chancery to determine the security for the claimant who rejected the offer` WITH `the corporation or successor entity has given notice in accordance with subsections (a) and (b)` IS TRUE, `the claimant has rejected the offer for security made pursuant to paragraph (b)(2)` IS TRUE
