#ASSERT (`s 280(c)(3) the reasonable fees and expenses of the guardian ad litem are paid by the petitioner` WITH `the Court of Chancery has appointed a guardian ad litem in the proceeding` IS FALSE) EQUALS NOTHING

§§ `s 280(d) to (g)`

-- (d): none of the three effects follows from giving a notice or making an offer.
#ASSERT NOT (`s 280(d) the giving of the notice or the making of the offer has the effect` WITH `the effect` IS `it revives a claim then barred`)
#ASSERT NOT (`s 280(d) the giving of the notice or the making of the offer has the effect` WITH `the effect` IS `it is an acknowledgment that the person to whom it is sent is a proper claimant`)
#ASSERT NOT (`s 280(d) the giving of the notice or the making of the offer has the effect` WITH `the effect` IS `it operates as a waiver of a defense or counterclaim in respect of a claim`)
