#ASSERT (`s 280(e) the entity is a successor entity` WITH `the entity is a trust, receivership or other legal entity governed by the laws of this State` IS TRUE, `the remaining assets and liabilities of the dissolved corporation are transferred to it` IS TRUE, `it exists solely for the purposes of prosecuting and defending suits, enabling the dissolved corporation to settle and close its business, disposing of and conveying its property, discharging its liabilities and distributing any remaining assets to its stockholders, but not for the purpose of continuing the business` IS TRUE) EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT (`s 280(e) the entity is a successor entity` WITH `the entity is a trust, receivership or other legal entity governed by the laws of this State` IS FALSE, `the remaining assets and liabilities of the dissolved corporation are transferred to it` IS TRUE, `it exists solely for the purposes of prosecuting and defending suits, enabling the dissolved corporation to settle and close its business, disposing of and conveying its property, discharging its liabilities and distributing any remaining assets to its stockholders, but not for the purpose of continuing the business` IS TRUE) EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT (`s 280(e) the entity is a successor entity` WITH `the entity is a trust, receivership or other legal entity governed by the laws of this State` IS TRUE, `the remaining assets and liabilities of the dissolved corporation are transferred to it` IS FALSE, `it exists solely for the purposes of prosecuting and defending suits, enabling the dissolved corporation to settle and close its business, disposing of and conveying its property, discharging its liabilities and distributing any remaining assets to its stockholders, but not for the purpose of continuing the business` IS TRUE) EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT (`s 280(e) the entity is a successor entity` WITH `the entity is a trust, receivership or other legal entity governed by the laws of this State` IS TRUE, `the remaining assets and liabilities of the dissolved corporation are transferred to it` IS TRUE, `it exists solely for the purposes of prosecuting and defending suits, enabling the dissolved corporation to settle and close its business, disposing of and conveying its property, discharging its liabilities and distributing any remaining assets to its stockholders, but not for the purpose of continuing the business` IS FALSE) EQUALS NOTHING
-- (f): a receiver or trustee and the Rules of the Court of Chancery varying the period or requirement: the Rules govern, not covered here.
#ASSERT (`s 280(f) the time periods and notice requirements of the section apply as the section states them` WITH `the Court of Chancery has appointed a receiver or trustee for the corporation or successor entity` IS TRUE, `the Rules of the Court of Chancery vary the time period or notice requirement` IS TRUE) EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT (`s 280(f) the time periods and notice requirements of the section apply as the section states them` WITH `the Court of Chancery has appointed a receiver or trustee for the corporation or successor entity` IS TRUE, `the Rules of the Court of Chancery vary the time period or notice requirement` IS FALSE) EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT (`s 280(f) the time periods and notice requirements of the section apply as the section states them` WITH `the Court of Chancery has appointed a receiver or trustee for the corporation or successor entity` IS FALSE, `the Rules of the Court of Chancery vary the time period or notice requirement` IS TRUE) EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT (`s 280(f) the time periods and notice requirements of the section apply as the section states them` WITH `the Court of Chancery has appointed a receiver or trustee for the corporation or successor entity` IS FALSE, `the Rules of the Court of Chancery vary the time period or notice requirement` IS FALSE) EQUALS JUST TRUE
