#ASSERT NOT (`s 280(g) the provisions of section 280 regarding distributions to members apply` WITH `the kind of corporation` IS `a charitable nonstock corporation`, `the provisions of section 280 regarding distributions to members conflict with other applicable law or with the corporation's certificate of incorporation or bylaws` IS TRUE)
#ASSERT `s 280(g) the provisions of section 280 regarding distributions to members apply` WITH `the kind of corporation` IS `a nonprofit nonstock corporation that is not charitable`, `the provisions of section 280 regarding distributions to members conflict with other applicable law or with the corporation's certificate of incorporation or bylaws` IS FALSE
