#ASSERT (`s 281(a) the distribution to the stockholders may be made` WITH `the date of the proposed distribution to the stockholders` IS YMD 2026 12 29, `the date of the last notice of rejections given pursuant to section 280(a)(3), if any was given` IS JUST (YMD 2026 8 1)) EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT (`s 281(a) the distribution to the stockholders may be made` WITH `the date of the proposed distribution to the stockholders` IS YMD 2026 12 30, `the date of the last notice of rejections given pursuant to section 280(a)(3), if any was given` IS JUST (YMD 2026 8 1)) EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT (`s 281(a) the distribution to the stockholders may be made` WITH `the date of the proposed distribution to the stockholders` IS YMD 2026 12 30, `the date of the last notice of rejections given pursuant to section 280(a)(3), if any was given` IS NOTHING) EQUALS NOTHING
-- The directors' judgment is conclusive in the absence of actual fraud.
