#ASSERT NOT (`s 281(b) the plan of distribution was adopted in time and provides what the subsection requires` WITH `the plan` IS (`t 281(b) plan` TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE FALSE), `the date the plan of distribution was adopted` IS YMD 2027 1 1, `the last day of the period described in section 278` IS YMD 2028 1 1)
