§ `s 282 Liability of stockholders of dissolved corporations`

-- (a): the lesser of the pro rata share of the claim and the amount distributed.
#ASSERT (`s 282(a) the most the stockholder is liable for on the claim` WITH `the assets of the dissolved corporation were distributed pursuant to section 281(a) or (b)` IS TRUE, `the stockholder's pro rata share of the claim` IS 100, `the amount distributed to the stockholder` IS 150) EQUALS JUST 100
#ASSERT (`s 282(a) the most the stockholder is liable for on the claim` WITH `the assets of the dissolved corporation were distributed pursuant to section 281(a) or (b)` IS TRUE, `the stockholder's pro rata share of the claim` IS 200, `the amount distributed to the stockholder` IS 150) EQUALS JUST 150
#ASSERT (`s 282(a) the most the stockholder is liable for on the claim` WITH `the assets of the dissolved corporation were distributed pursuant to section 281(a) or (b)` IS TRUE, `the stockholder's pro rata share of the claim` IS 150, `the amount distributed to the stockholder` IS 150) EQUALS JUST 150
-- The section speaks only of a corporation whose assets were distributed under section 281(a) or (b).
#ASSERT (`s 282(a) the most the stockholder is liable for on the claim` WITH `the assets of the dissolved corporation were distributed pursuant to section 281(a) or (b)` IS FALSE, `the stockholder's pro rata share of the claim` IS 100, `the amount distributed to the stockholder` IS 150) EQUALS NOTHING
-- (b): a distribution under 281(a) and no action begun before the end of the section 278 period: not liable.
#ASSERT (`s 282(b) the stockholder is not liable for the claim` WITH `the assets of the dissolved corporation were distributed pursuant to section 281(a)` IS TRUE, `an action, suit or proceeding on the claim was begun prior to the expiration of the period described in section 278` IS FALSE) EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT (`s 282(b) the stockholder is not liable for the claim` WITH `the assets of the dissolved corporation were distributed pursuant to section 281(a)` IS TRUE, `an action, suit or proceeding on the claim was begun prior to the expiration of the period described in section 278` IS TRUE) EQUALS NOTHING
-- A distribution under 281(b) only (a plan of distribution) gets no immunity under (b).
#ASSERT (`s 282(b) the stockholder is not liable for the claim` WITH `the assets of the dissolved corporation were distributed pursuant to section 281(a)` IS FALSE, `an action, suit or proceeding on the claim was begun prior to the expiration of the period described in section 278` IS FALSE) EQUALS NOTHING
-- (c): all the claims together never exceed the amount distributed.
#ASSERT (`s 282(c) the most the stockholder is liable for on all the claims together` WITH `the amounts for which the stockholder is liable on each claim` IS (LIST 100, 200), `the amount distributed to the stockholder in dissolution` IS 250) EQUALS 250
#ASSERT (`s 282(c) the most the stockholder is liable for on all the claims together` WITH `the amounts for which the stockholder is liable on each claim` IS (LIST 100, 200), `the amount distributed to the stockholder in dissolution` IS 400) EQUALS 300
#ASSERT (`s 282(c) the most the stockholder is liable for on all the claims together` WITH `the amounts for which the stockholder is liable on each claim` IS EMPTY, `the amount distributed to the stockholder in dissolution` IS 400) EQUALS 0

